    "CoiStatement": "Farhan Shahid and Eduard Shantsila declare that they have no competing interests. Gregory Y. H. Lip has served as a consultant for Bayer/Janssen, BMS/Pfizer, Biotronik, Medtronic, Boehringer Ingelheim, Microlife, and Daiichi-Sankyo and a speaker for Bayer, BMS/Pfizer, Medtronic, Boehringer Ingelheim, Microlife, Roche, and Daiichi-Sankyo. No competing interests were disclosed. No competing interests were disclosed. No competing interests were disclosed.",
